{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393820/extras/62bbae8adb8cdb60596c3e119ffac072.poster.avif?t=1766414006\" width=600 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393820/extras/62bbae8adb8cdb60596c3e119ffac072.webm?t=1766414006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>ENCOUNTER</strong></i></u><i><strong> </strong></i>dangerous monsters as you explore caves, castles, and crypts on journeying through your childhood home of Vann\u2019s Point and beyond the world of Lyrian! <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393820/extras/03d6edf808cca6e1c9b977afb145456c.avif?t=1766414006\" width=595 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>OVERCOME</strong></i></u><i><strong> </strong></i>any challenge that stands between you and redemption on your return to a now unfamiliar childhood home. Face the sins of your past and reunite with friends from years past. Even ignite new relationships as you right the wrongs that haunt you! <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393820/extras/c4dec20690342e60ae27546d2038e9a3.avif?t=1766414006\" width=595 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>DISCOVER</strong></i></u><i><strong> </strong></i>mysterious secrets of those who came before as you collect fragments of long forgotten knowledge. Learn of dangerous prophecies and legends foretelling what is yet to come! <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393820/extras/7bcd78e8048304a2411bbf8e845d59d1.avif?t=1766414006\" width=595 height=283 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless ways to play: Chaos, Altars, Curses and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic hybrid chiptune/organic OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, story-building side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than a dozen dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive post-game content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 24 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 pursuable relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty more!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Homecoming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/6987500a275d59048b11af838c962ce762528b48.jpg"},{"name":"Nightfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/81391a97023e429cbdfb22e8545bbf759d7777e9.jpg"},{"name":"Color Corrected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/4f14de8b7230ad1f129c4db6b94e7ae77526f863.jpg"},{"name":"Setting Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/e187524db87861dd3fc4e02759c051fc66229237.jpg"},{"name":"Prodigal Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/e872b1b821461aaf9408402dc469f1337b111739.jpg"},{"name":"Debtless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1393820/222c2ba9f8141ef1cf0995b20fa8e93bfaec504c.jpg"},{"name":"Keaton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap